{"id": "111-1-A-062", "year": 111, "session": 1, "subject": "A", "number": 62, "stem": "16 歲的男學生，上課途中突然感覺右下腹劇烈疼痛，老師馬上帶他到急診室求診。醫師為他做了一系列檢\n查，發現有急性闌尾炎（ acute appendicitis ）合併破裂，於是緊急開刀切除闌尾（ appendix ）。此疾病最有可\n能是下列那一種發炎？", "options": {"A": "漿液性發炎（ serous inflammation ）", "B": "纖維蛋白性發炎（ fibrinous inflammation ）", "C": "出血性發炎（ hemorrhagic inflammation ）", "D": "化膿性發炎（ suppurative inflammation ）"}, "answer": "D", "answer_note": null, "answer_revised": false, "topics": [], "difficulty": null, "has_figure": false, "figures": [], "source": "sources/111_1/11_Q.pdf", "ingested_at": "2026-09-10T03:46:33+00:00", "needs_review": false}
